      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. it feels almost like the molecules are actively trying to resist the stabilization efforts. when the acid hits, do we see any specific structural changes in the interfacial film that would explain why they seem to evade the lecithin so aggressively?",
      "source": "evaluator"
